<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - QUILMES CUT.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - QUILMES CUT.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robert Fleming said analyst Thomas Mobille had cut his rating for Latin American brewer and bottler Quilmes Industrial SA to reduce from hold.</p>
<p>-- In a March 26 analysis, Mobille said the company's shares were slightly overvalued, adding, &quot;We believe Quilmes' fair trading range is between $9.50 and $10.50.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts closed on Wednesday at 11-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
